UgxSAuaR3lhL-qfSQbZ4AaABAg,,False,@Lose-My-Breath-143,"How are you, fellow STAYs? I am feeling so down today because I have a K-pop stan friend, I recommended this song to her. The next day, she told she HATE this song, how could she bruhhh- I can't even imagine someone not loving this amazing song, the rap, the vocals, the acting---ALL ON TOP!! I still couldn't understand why she hated this song so bad.. maybe she don't like raps? Or she don't like rocking songs?? Because the music the group she stan sang are all more calming songs compared to Skz's music. I kind of get it but... she told me she HATED it.. I don't get why she express he dislike of music taste by hating on a master piece.",8,2024-08-05T11:32:19Z,2024-08-05T11:32:19Z
UgxSAuaR3lhL-qfSQbZ4AaABAg.A6kr4Tgn-s2A6lTZMIRyYl,UgxSAuaR3lhL-qfSQbZ4AaABAg,True,@Magicshop9072,"Don't worry luv, not everyone has good taste in music, Stray Kids’ songs are renowned for their deeply personal and motivational lyrics, self-discovery, resilience, and overcoming challenges, the group creates music that resonates on a profound level. Their lyrics often reflect their own experiences and struggles, making them relatable to stays who find solace and encouragement in the messages.  Through their thoughtful and heartfelt songwriting, Stray Kids not only entertain but also inspire and uplift their audience.❤ don't stop listening to stray kids because of them luv❤‍🩹 your not the only one tbh, one of my friends also hated on masterpieces like ""stay gold"" by bts and ""hellevator"" by stray kids and i was like ""how could she hate on these masterpieces""? cuz it just impossible for me lol,  I totally get how frustrating it can be when someone doesn’t share the same enthusiasm for a song you love. Music is such a personal experience, and everyone has their own tastes and preferences💖💗. It sounds like your friend might have a different style or genre preference, which could explain why she didn’t connect with the song the same way you do💜. It's tough when someone doesn't appreciate something you think is amazing, but it’s important to remember that not everyone has the same taste in music. Maybe your friend just prefers a different vibe or sound, and that’s okay. i feel your pain, half of my friends are kpop fans and most of them love them for visuals and hate on idols for stupid reasons ""they are toxic"". they also started saying that i listen to overrated music like BTS but i don't care about their thoughts, i will listen to bts forever, so don't stop listening to stray kids because of a kpop friend💗 btw here's some stray kids calming songs that i think she would like ""Airplane, leave, cover me, winter falls,Astronaut, secret secret, FNF, DLC, TASTE,Get cool, lonely st, charmer,surfin', gone away, mixtape OH,Mixtape#2,Mixtape#3,Ex,wow,easy,Another day,blue print,mixtape: on track,Grow up,Levanter"" i think she would like these songs imo",2,2024-08-05T17:17:20Z,2024-08-05T17:37:28Z
