UgwKlQbnHfdgjOBlCPx4AaABAg,,False,@olakryger5605,"Dear Stray Kids,

I want to express my deepest gratitude to each and every one of you for being a source of light and strength in my life. Your smiles have the power to brighten even my darkest days, your music resonates with me on a level that words cannot describe, and your attitude towards life inspires me to keep pushing forward no matter what challenges come my way.

Your Smiles:

Every time I see your smiles, it’s as if a weight is lifted off my shoulders. Your genuine happiness and positivity are infectious, and they never fail to bring a smile to my face. In moments of sadness or despair, just a glimpse of your smiles can turn my entire day around. It’s like a ray of sunshine breaking through the clouds, reminding me that there is always hope and joy to be found in this world.

Your Music:

The music you create is more than just songs to me; it’s a lifeline. Your lyrics speak to me in ways that nothing else can, capturing emotions and experiences that I thought were mine alone. Each beat, each melody, each word is a testament to the passion and dedication you pour into your craft. Listening to your music feels like coming home, like finding solace in a world that can often feel chaotic and overwhelming.

Your Attitude:

Your attitude towards life is nothing short of inspiring. The way you face challenges head-on, the way you support each other as a team, the way you stay true to yourselves no matter what - it all serves as a constant reminder for me to stay strong and resilient in the face of adversity. Your authenticity and humility shine through in everything you do, showing me that success is not just about talent but also about hard work, perseverance, and staying true to who you are.

In conclusion, I want to thank each member of Stray Kids for being beacons of light in my life. Your smiles, your music, and your attitude have saved me in more ways than I can count. You are not just artists to me; you are friends, mentors, and sources of endless inspiration. Thank you for everything.

With love and gratitude,
stay (tina)
